    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2015-09-16/15-247#art_29> ;
    dznorm:position 1 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2015-09-16/15-247#art_29_condition_1_d917a64d_role_4da5325117> a dznorm:Role ;
