    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2015-09-16/15-247#art_72> ;
    dznorm:position 3 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2015-09-16/15-247#art_72_condition_4_54e79173> a dznorm:Condition ;
